and then it's a secret floor,

00:02:13.334 --> 00:02:15.033
a secret bottom.
-Right, you open up --

00:02:15.033 --> 00:02:17.567
-You open up and you have
a whole nother Valentine's Day.

00:02:17.567 --> 00:02:18.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.634 --> 00:02:19.701
How about this example?

00:02:19.701 --> 00:02:21.667
If you take Buddhism...
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:21.667 --> 00:02:25.167
-...plus vegan cheese...
-Vegan cheese. Okay.

00:02:25.167 --> 00:02:27.133
-...yeah, it equals Zendaya.

00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:29.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:29.467 --> 00:02:33.367
Finally, if you take the
Olympic logo plus an emo phase,

00:02:33.367 --> 00:02:34.567
